          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dharkii uu cudurka barasku ku yaal, hadduu yahay dhar dhogor idaad ah amase dhar wanaagsan oo linen ah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hadduu ku jiro dunta fidsan amase tan gudubsan ee dharka wanaagsan oo linenka ah, ama kan dhogorta idaad ah, iyo hadduu ku jiro haragga ama wax alla wixii harag laga sameeyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haddii cudurku ka cagaaran yahay ama ka guduudan yahay dharka ama haragga ama dunta fidsan ama tan gudubsan ama waxa alla wixii harag laga sameeyo, kaasu waa cudurkii baraska oo waa in wadaadka la tusaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaadkuna waa inuu fiiriyaa cudurkaas, oo waxaas cudurka qabana waa inuu meel ku xereeyaa intii toddoba maalmood ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana maalinta toddobaad waa inuu cudurka fiiriyaa, oo haddii cudurku dharka kaga sii faafay dunta fidsan ama tan gudubsan, ama haragga dhexdiisa, haraggaas hawl kasta oo loogu isticmaalaba, markaas cudurku waa baras wax xaganaya oo waxaasu waa nijaasaysan yahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna waa inuu gubaa dharkaas cudurku ku jiro, hadduu yahay dunta fidsan ama tan gudubsan oo ku jirta dharka dhogorta idaad ah ama kan wanaagsan oo linenka ah, ama wax kasta oo harag laga sameeyey, waayo, kaasu waa baras wax xaganaya, ee waa in dab lagu gubaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddii wadaadku fiiriyo, oo markaa cudurkii uusan dharka kaga sii faafin dunta fidsan ama tan gudubsan toona, ama wax harag laga sameeyey, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "markaas wadaadku waa inuu ku amraa in la maydhaa waxaas cudurka qaba, oo isagu haddana waa inuu waxaas meel ku xereeyaa intii toddoba maalmood oo kale ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wadaadku waa inuu fiiriyaa, markii cudurka laga maydho dabadeed, oo bal eeg, cudurka midabkiisu hadduusan beddelmin, iyo haddii cudurku uusan faafinba, waxaasu waa nijaas, oo waa inaad dab ku gubtaa, oo haddii meeshii xumayd kaga taal hoosta ama dushaba, taasu waa wax xaganaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.55",
