          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa sharciga ku saabsan cudurka baraska ahu markuu dharka dhogorta idaad ah ama dharka wanaagsan oo linenka ah kaga dhaco dunta fidsan ama tan gudubsan, ama waxa kasta oo harag laga sameeyo, in la yidhaahdo, Waxaasu waa daahir, ama in la yidhaahdo, Waa nijaas.",
          "type": "text",
